        "TileImage": "$($repository eb3fafa6-9e4a-4ebe-a87a-3287c3bf98f1).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rOur client has asked us to eliminate 5 targets in the Burj Al Ghazali building. We have been informed that due to tightened security, changing disguises and bringing any frisk detected gun will instantly compromise us. 5mm is your only weapon for this mission and there&apos;s only 5 shots, for 5 kills. It&apos;s time to get your aim in the game, happy hunting.",
